  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of rhino and tiger in Orang National Park, Assam, India, through infrastructure development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to enhance the quality of living condition of the anti-poaching patrol staff of Orang National Park. The project will be responsible for the construction of 3 anti-poaching camps with watch towers, and making drinking water available for all three camps.</narrative>
  </description>
